   448                                                  ; ---- can the STOCK geometry already reach the whole card? --
   449                                                  ; Stock FDPT: EBDA:003D (drive 0x80) / EBDA:004D (0x81).
   450                                                  ;   reported C = ([+0] >> [+4]) - 2
