   626                                                  ; floppy path we have not located the block yet, so read the
   627                                                  ; vector if we can, else fall back to the boot-block handler
   628                                                  ; at F000:D2D7, which is in the never-erased boot block and is
   629                                                  ; a complete INT 13h implementation (it forwards floppies to
   630                                                  ; INT 40h exactly like the stock chain).
