   921                                  ; ============================================================================
   922                                  ;  ATA_RW -- LBA28 PIO transfer core.  ES = block.
   923                                  ;  In : V_LBA, V_CNT, V_BUFSEG:V_BUFOFF, V_CMD (0x20 read / 0x30 write)
   924                                  ;  Out: AL = INT 13h status (0 = success), V_DONE = sectors transferred.
   925                                  ;  V_BUFOFF is advanced as it goes; callers must not rely on it afterwards.
   926                                  ; ============================================================================
